			<ul>
				<li>Want writing samples?</li>
				<li>Looking for feedback on sketches?</li>
				<li>Want a link to watch "The Debut"?</li>
				<li>Want to chat?</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				email: jbronen [at] gmail [dot] com<br>
				instagram: <a href="http://instagram.com/jbronen">@jbronen</a><br>
				linkedin: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaredbronen">linkedin.com/in/jaredbronen</a>
			</p>
			<p>
				Note: I am not looking for / soliciting work related to software engineering at this time, thank you!
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
